  "The split-screen battle panels for three or four screens (0x203f50, the weapon records 0x204a20 left and 0x204d90 right), in the 320x240 canvas of one screen, from game_vs_tex (slot 466) and game_tex (slot 464). Same schema as battle_panels.json.",
  "With more than one screen the original (0x4aaed, 0x4ad3b) draws no DAY, TIME, MONEY or SHOOTDOWN labels, no DAMAGED / HIT / BINGO! messages and no ammunition or charge bars: their sections are left out. The weapon panel is the 64x16 icon strip on its frame, the digits above it.",
  "The warning and MISSILE ALERT sit near the screen's middle here, so they are centre-anchored (the anchors are the port's)."
